han the Classic Baguette</p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-start items-start gap-4 bg-black p-10 rounded-xl h-60 opacity-75"><h1 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl">PEKAN RAISIN</h1><p class="text-lg text-slate-200">Naturally leavened bread made using the French Country dough with the additions of local Georgia pecans and Thompson raisins</p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-start items-start gap-4 bg-black p-10 rounded-xl h-60 opacity-75"><h1 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl">EVERYDAY FRENCH</h1><p class="text-lg text-slate-200">Everyday table loaf made using the Classic Baguette dough</p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-start items-start gap-4 bg-black p-10 rounded-xl h-60 opacity-75"><h1 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl">MULTIGRAIN</h1><p class="text-lg text-slate-200">Naturally leavened bread made using the French Country dough with the additions of millet, quinoa, rolled oats, flax seeds, and sunflower seeds</p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-start items-start gap-4 bg-black p-10 rounded-xl h-60 opacity-75"><h1 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl">DANISH RYE</h1><p class="text-lg text-slate-200">Whole rye flour, cracked rye berries, water, natural leaven culture made with rye flour, pumpkin seeds, sunflower seeds, barley malt syrup, sea salt</p></div></div></section><section class="w-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-6 py-20 lg:px-20 px-10 bg-[#f3f2f2]"><h1 data-aos="zoom-in" class="text-[50px] text-black text-center leading-[60px] aos-init">Our freshly baked bread is the <br>hero of our breakfast menu</h1><p data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="200" class="text-center text-xl text-slate-600 aos-init">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Eius nihil harum<br> amet consequuntur facilis sint tempore iusto necessitatibus illum fuga.</p><button data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="400" class="border-2 border-black rounded-full px-14 py-4 font-bold aos-init">READ MORE</button><d